Package: xbee2mqtt
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), passwd, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: alejandro-md-keyring
Description: XBee ZigBee to MQTT gateway
 Watches a coordinator XBee radio in API mode on a serial port, publishes
 what the remote radios report to an MQTT broker, and sets their digital
 pins from MQTT messages. Can announce the radios to Home Assistant through
 MQTT discovery.
 .
 Runs as the xbee2mqtt systemd service, which is installed but not enabled.
 Edit /etc/xbee2mqtt/xbee2mqtt.yaml, then run
 `sudo systemctl enable --now xbee2mqtt`. xbee2mqtt-probe finds the baud
 rate and mode a radio answers on.
